<title>BAHRAIN: PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Dec 9.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Dec 9.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Bahraini press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>GULF DAILY NEWS</p>
<p>- Bahrain's emir praises strong ties with the Philippines during talks with Vice-President Joseph Estrada.</p>
<p>AKHBAR AL-KHALEEJ</p>
<p>- Bahrain proposes the formation of a Gulf Arab committee to discuss Qatar-Bahrain territorial dispute. Bahrain has boycotted a Gulf Arab summit in Qatar over the dispute.</p>
<p>AL-AYAM</p>
<p>- Uzbekistan starts flights to Bahrain.</p>
